# Firebase service account — a LIVE CREDENTIAL that can send push to every
# family and read project data. The client configs (google-services.json,
# GoogleService-Info.plist) are NOT secret and stay committed: they ship inside
# the APK and CI needs them to build. This one never does.
/storage/app/firebase/
*-service-account*.json

# Deploy SSH key — the private half lets anyone push a release to the server.
/storage/app/deploy/
